# --- Room 1/25 ---
dig Frozen Tundra of the North - Entrance
@desc Endless dunes of ancient sand stretch in every direction, their crests sculpted by the darkened wind. The faint luminescence is harsh and unforgiving, and you see a dark bloodstain shimmering in the heat haze.
@tags/set room-zone:frozen_tundra
